      "camera": "wide shot, low angle emphasizing alien geometry descending",
      "action": "三个苍白几何体（正八面体）无声降下。猎人们重新出现在远处，震惊观望。",
      "dialogue": [],
      "emotion": "alien_dread",
      "prompt_visual": "Wide shot, dramatic low angle. Three pale octahedral geometric forms descend silently from the torn sky. They are perfect mathematical shapes - eight-sided, approximately 2 meters across, surface like polished bone or dead pearl. They emit no light but seem to absorb it, creating darkness around themselves. Their descent is utterly silent and unnaturally smooth - no wind displacement, no sound. In the background, the three hunters have returned, frozen in primitive terror at the edge of the clearing. Fuxi is in the foreground, still kneeling, looking up. The contrast is stark: organic, irregular swamp life versus perfect, sterile geometry. The Entropy Units represent cosmic horror - intelligence without warmth.",
      "prompt_motion": "The three Units descend in perfect formation, maintaining exact spacing. They rotate slowly on their axes, faces shifting but overall position stable. They stop hovering approximately 3 meters above the swamp water. No splash, no ripple. Complete violation of natural physics. The hunters back away slowly. Fuxi remains transfixed.",
      "transition_out": "cut",
      "transition_duration_s": 0,
      "transition_note": "Hard cut to Unit close-up for dialogue delivery. The abrupt cut mimics the jarring alien communication style.",
      "sfx_bgm": "Absence of natural sound as Units appear - they create a bubble of silence. Then a low, subsonic hum that feels wrong. Hunters' frightened breathing. No music - pure dread.",
      "notes": "The Entropy Units should feel WRONG - their geometry is too perfect, their movement too smooth. They are agents of cosmic order/death, antithetical to life's beautiful chaos.",
      "location_ref": "primordial_swamp_rainstorm"
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S16",
      "scene": "1-4",
      "duration_s": 4,
      "location": "leize_swamp_clearing",
      "characters": [
        "Entropy_Unit_1",
        "Hunter_B"
      ],
      "camera": "medium shot, then graphic horror as hunter dissolves",
      "action": "熵单位以机械音发出检测，黑色数据流卷向猎人乙。猎人身体开始像素化分解。",
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "character": "Entropy_Unit_1",
          "text": "检测到异常代码残留。执行提取分析。",
          "emotion": "mechanical_cold",
          "speed": 0.9
        }
      ],
      "emotion": "horror_violation",
      "prompt_visual": "Medium shot of one Entropy Unit. Its surface ripples as it speaks - the voice seems to come from everywhere and nowhere, mechanical and ancient. From its vertices, tendrils of BLACK data emerge - anti-light, negative space given form. These tendrils streak toward Hunter B with terrifying speed. The hunter screams, tries to run. Contact. His body begins to pixelate from the point of contact - flesh breaks into data cubes that dissolve into nothing. It spreads like digital decomposition. His face freezes in a scream as it fragments. The other hunters scramble away in absolute terror. The horror is clinical, efficient, utterly without malice - which makes it worse. Fuxi watches, his left eye tracking the black data streams, seeing their code structure.",
      "prompt_motion": "The Unit's surface ripples with speech. Black tendrils shoot out with mechanical precision. Hunter B's escape attempt is futile - the tendrils move at inhuman speed. His body begins fragmenting: first his arm (contact point), then spreading across his torso. Pixel cubes float upward briefly before dissolving to nothing. The whole dissolution takes only seconds. His scream cuts off mid-sound as his head pixelates.",
      "transition_out": "cut",
      "transition_duration_s": 0,
      "transition_note": "Cut on Fuxi's scream - his emotional reaction drives into his first act of resistance. The cut from victim to hero creates narrative momentum.",
      "sfx_bgm": "The Entropy Unit's voice is multi-layered mechanical tones, devoid of warmth. The black data tendrils have a 'reverse' sound - like audio being deleted. Hunter B's scream is horrifyingly cut short. A discordant tone rises.",
      "notes": "First demonstration of Entropy threat - they don't kill, they ERASE. This is worse than death - it's existential deletion. The clinical nature emphasizes their alien morality.",
      "location_ref": "primordial_swamp_rainstorm"
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S17",
      "scene": "1-4",
      "duration_s": 4,
      "location": "leize_swamp_clearing",
      "characters": [
        "Young_Fuxi",
        "Entropy_Unit_1"
      ],
      "camera": "dynamic action sequence - Fuxi's intervention",
      "action": "伏羲怒吼，无意识伸手。在代码视觉中他'看到'黑色数据流的锯齿结构，本能地'抓住'并扯断！",
      "dialogue": [
