      "emotion": "desperate_defiance",
      "prompt_visual": "Dynamic action shot of Fuxi leaping to his feet, arm extended toward the black data stream. His face is contorted with rage and desperation. Through his code-vision (visualized as overlay): the black data stream is revealed as a jagged, serrated structure - like digital barbed wire. His left eye blazes gold. His hand, wreathed in faint golden light, GRABS the black stream. Contact creates sparks of gold and black. With a primal scream, he TEARS the data tendril apart. The black code shatters into fragments that dissolve. The remaining hunters stare in disbelief. The Entropy Units pause - the first hesitation we've seen from them. Fuxi stands, breathing hard, not understanding what he just did but knowing he did it.",
      "prompt_motion": "Fuxi's body moves explosively - survival instinct fused with new power. His arm sweeps through the air and impossibly makes contact with the intangible data stream. Golden energy crackles along his arm. He pulls and twists - the black stream stretches, then snaps like breaking a physical rope. Black fragments scatter and vanish. Fuxi stumbles back from the effort, shocked by his own ability.",
      "transition_out": "cut",
      "transition_duration_s": 0,
      "transition_note": "Cut to Entropy Unit reaction - their acknowledgment of Fuxi as threat elevates the stakes immediately.",
      "sfx_bgm": "Fuxi's scream is raw, primal. The sound of grabbing data is like electrical discharge mixed with tearing fabric. When the stream breaks, a discordant snap echoes. Momentary silence as everyone processes what happened.",
      "notes": "First display of Fuxi's code manipulation ability. It's instinctive, not controlled - he acts without understanding. This establishes his potential and his current limitation.",
      "location_ref": "primordial_swamp_rainstorm"
    },
    {
