      "emotion": "escalating_conflict",
      "prompt_visual": "Medium shot of the three Entropy Units. Their surfaces pulse with increased activity - data patterns racing across their geometric faces. They speak in unison now, voices overlapping. From all three, additional black tendrils emerge - dozens of them, creating a net of deletion. Wide shot: Fuxi, desperate, slams his palm into the mud. Through code-vision: he sees the soil's molecular code. He WRENCHES it, rewriting structure. The ground beneath the Units transforms - solid mud becomes quicksand. The Units sink partially, their perfect hovering disrupted for the first time. They struggle briefly, tendrils redirecting to free themselves. It's a moment's reprieve, nothing more, but it proves Fuxi can affect the physical world through code.",
      "prompt_motion": "The Units' threat assessment triggers visible changes - their surfaces become more aggressive, angular. Black tendrils multiply and reach toward Fuxi. He drops to his knees, hands on ground. Golden energy pulses from his palms into the earth. The mud ripples, liquefies. Units drop suddenly as their hovering fails over unstable matter. They tilt, sink, tendrils flailing. It's chaotic and desperate on both sides.",
      "transition_out": "object_pass",
      "transition_duration_s": 0.3,
      "transition_note": "A bone arrow flies across frame from off-screen, the motion passing in front of camera provides natural transition coverage. The arrow's green glow introduces Nuwa before we see her. Audio: arrow whistle precedes visual by 0.2s (micro J-cut).",
      "sfx_bgm": "Units' combined voice creates harmonic resonance - unsettling. Multiple data tendril sounds layer. Fuxi's exertion grunt. Earth transformation has a liquefying sound. Then: the sharp whistle of an approaching arrow.",
      "notes": "Fuxi's second ability demonstration: environmental manipulation. It's crude but effective. The Units' momentary confusion shows they've never encountered this resistance.",
      "location_ref": "primordial_swamp_rainstorm"
    },
