      "emotion": "unexpected_rescue",
      "prompt_visual": "Dynamic tracking shot following a bone arrow wrapped in spiraling green energy as it streaks through the rain. The arrow impacts near the lead Entropy Unit, exploding into a web of green vines that momentarily entangle it. Camera pulls back dramatically to reveal the shooter: Nuwa, 17 years old, standing on a cliff edge above the swamp. She is fierce and wild - wearing layered leather and bone armor decorated with feathers and small skulls. Her hair is braided with vines. Her eyes carry an otherworldly green glow. She already has another arrow nocked, her stance powerful and protective. Lightning backlight creates a heroic silhouette. She screams her command to Fuxi with desperate urgency. She is the embodiment of primal power meeting supernatural ability.",
      "prompt_motion": "Arrow flies in graceful arc, trailing green luminescence. Impact creates instantaneous vine explosion - organic versus geometric. Camera whip-pans to follow the arrow's origin, racing up the cliff face to find Nuwa. She looses another arrow even as she shouts. Her green glow intensifies with each action. Her command echoes across the swamp.",
