      "emotion": "ominous_conclusion",
      "prompt_visual": "Tracking shot of Fuxi stumbling through swamp vegetation, looking back over his shoulder. His left eye still glows faintly, his body exhausted from exertion. He crashes through underbrush, splashing through water. Wide shot: the three Entropy Units have freed themselves and now hover together, their forms merging slightly into a triangular formation. Data streams connect them as they communicate. Above them, a beam of pale light shoots upward through the storm clouds - a signal being sent. The Units slowly rotate, scanning, but do not pursue. Their work here is reconnaissance now. The swamp feels vast and dark around Fuxi as he runs. Nuwa visible on distant cliff, watching.",
      "prompt_motion": "Fuxi runs desperately, stumbling, catching himself, continuing. Camera tracks alongside him. Cut to Units: they reform into formation, movements now synchronized perfectly. The signal beam pulses upward. They begin slow, methodical scanning rotation. The storm seems to intensify around them, as if nature itself rejects their presence.",
      "transition_out": "fade_out",
