      "transition_note": "Long fade to black on the Units' ominous signal. The extended fade creates dread - this is not an ending but a beginning of larger conflict. Audio continues briefly: the signal's transmission sound, then silence. Text card could appear: 'To be continued' or episode title.",
      "sfx_bgm": "Running footsteps, splashing, heavy breathing. Units' report is cold, clinical, devoid of emotion. The signal beam has a high-frequency transmission sound. Music becomes low, ominous drone. Storm sounds fade with the visual.",
      "notes": "Cliffhanger ending establishes ongoing threat. The Units' report to 'Central Arbiter' introduces larger antagonist hierarchy. Fuxi has been marked - his life is changed forever.",
